According to a new report from Intel Market Research, the global Software And BPO Services market was valued at USD 345.2 billion in 2025 and is projected to reach USD 521.4 billion by 2034, growing at a robust CAGR of 4.8% during the forecast period (2025–2034). This expansion is driven by accelerating digital transformation, widespread cloud adoption, and increasing demand for high value process automation solutions.
The market encompasses a broad spectrum of offerings, from bespoke software development and platform integration to comprehensive outsourcing of finance, HR, customer support and procurement functions. Providers span onshore, nearshore and offshore models, leveraging global talent pools and advanced analytics to deliver scalable and cost effective solutions.
